{
  "name": "Relentless Rage",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Rage can keep you fighting despite grievous wounds. If you drop to 0 Hit Points while your Rage is active and don't die outright, you can make a DC 10 Constitution Saving Throw. If you succeed, your Hit Points instead change to a number equal to twice your Barbarian level.</p><p>Each time you use this feature after the first, the DC increases by 5. When you finish a Short or a Long Rest, the DC resets to 10.</p>",
